  "plan": {
    "goal": "Co-incubate UGT2B7 with 4-methylumbelliferone at 103.5 µM in the presence of a competitive inhibitor (Ki = 143.5 µM) at 35.1 µM and quantify the fractional activity remaining, inhibited velocity, and percent inhibition.",
    "rationale": "Competitive inhibition of UGT2B7-catalyzed glucuronidation of 4-methylumbelliferone. Substrate [S] = 103.5 µM is below Km (205.2 µM), so the competitive inhibitor (Ki = 143.5 µM) at 35.1 µM is expected to substantially reduce activity. Fractional activity follows v_i/v_0 = [S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]); inhibited velocity = fractional activity × Vmax (5.8985 µmol/min); percent inhibition = (1 − fractional activity) × 100. Apparent Km rises to 255.4 µM (competitive signature), run-condition IC50 = 215.9 µM, [I]/[S] = 0.339.",
